<title>FRANCE: Pathe 1996 sales rise strongly.</title>
<headline>Pathe 1996 sales rise strongly.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 1,841    vs    1,093</p>
<p>NOTE - Pathe, the media company created out of the break up of the Chargeurs holding company last year, published its sales figures in the official bulletin BALO. It said the 1995 figures were restated to take account of the break up.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
